---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Legal & Privacy" seo={{ page_description: "Legal and privacy information for FreeFileForm." }}>
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-8 prose prose-lg">
      <h1 class="font-heading text-[var(--color-primary)]">Legal & Privacy</h1>

      <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>The content provided on FreeFileForm.com is for informational purposes only. We do not provide legal, accounting, or tax advice. We are not affiliated with the Internal Revenue Service (IRS) or the United States Government.</p>
      <p>While we strive to keep information accurate and up-to-date, tax laws change frequently. Always verify figures against primary sources like IRS.gov.</p>

      <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p>We respect your privacy. If you use our contact forms, calculators, or subscribe to our newsletter, we only collect the information you voluntarily provide.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Calculators:</strong> Data entered into our calculators is processed entirely in your browser. We do not store your financial information unless you explicitly choose to have your results emailed to you via our forms.</li>
        <li><strong>Forms:</strong> Submissions are securely transmitted to our capture server. We will not sell your email address.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> We use privacy-respecting analytics (OpenObserve) to understand how visitors use our site. This telemetry does not track you across other websites.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
      <p>Some links on this site may be affiliate links. If you click them and make a purchase or sign up for a service, we may earn a small commission at no extra cost to you. However, our primary goal is to highlight truly free filing options.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
